me>Chai</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tarnawski</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Identification of specific genes and pathways involved in NSAIDs-induced apoptosis of human colon cancer cells</article-title><source>World J. Gastroenterol</source><volume>12</volume><fpage>6446</fpage><lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17072976</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b19-cin-03-125"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Joo</surname><given-names>YE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>HS</given-names></name><name><surname>Min</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Expression of cyclooxygenase-2 protein in colorectal carcinomas</article-title><source>Int. J. Gastrointest. Cancer</source><volume>31</volume><fpage>147</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12622426</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b20-cin-03-125"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Joo</surname><given-names>YE</given-names></name><name><surname>Rew</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Seo</surname><given-names>YH</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Cyclooxygenase-2 overexpression correlates with vascular endothelial growth factor expression and tumor angiogenesis in gastric cancer</article-title><source>J. Clin. Gastroenterol</source><volume>37</volume><fpage>28</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12811205</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b21-cin-03-125"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Juuti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Louhimo</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Nordling</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-